extraction_notes: |
  - Read from the OCR cache of a scan and verified against 200 dpi renders of
    printed 102, 103 and 104. The heading "The Fallen Knights" is below the
    Cosmo-Knight''s Cybernetics line in the right column of printed 102, and the
